    "name": "Final Notice",
    "steam_appid": 3816330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/c61a5ef437f5bd053a3a8ad7812432f0.poster.avif?t=1754473299\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/c61a5ef437f5bd053a3a8ad7812432f0.webm?t=1754473299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/c61a5ef437f5bd053a3a8ad7812432f0.mp4?t=1754473299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A single-player card game about killing gods. Through proper channels.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a reaper. Employed, salaried, and fully compliant under <strong>The Authority</strong> - a bureaucratic force responsible for the administration of death. Your job used to be simple: collect mortal souls, file the paperwork, move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then came the recall order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods - previously marked as exempt - are now to be processed. Unfortunately, an ancient clause prevents direct intervention. Immortality must be surrendered willingly, through loss in a sanctioned contest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They chose a card game.<br>You were assigned to play it.<br>Try not to make mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 player cards for you to theorycraft and deckbuild with, with more coming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mortis: a resource drawn directly from your own soul. Use it wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI-driven bosses constructed from adjective + domain traits (e.g. <i>Roaring Dreams</i>, <i>Hateful Fire</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status effects like <i>Banished</i>, <i>Fogged</i>, and <i>Entombed</i>\u00a0- each with lasting consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Codex paths offer an alternate route to victory - or at least to survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decks themed around roles within The Authority: Auditor, Archivist, Enforcer, and worse</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/ec8407b8c8070425970cda4e9ef8b9a1.poster.avif?t=1754473299\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/ec8407b8c8070425970cda4e9ef8b9a1.webm?t=1754473299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/ec8407b8c8070425970cda4e9ef8b9a1.mp4?t=1754473299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THIS DEMO INCLUDES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounty mode, where you can fight scripted bosses of legend!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable core loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding and preset decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status systems and balance pass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedural boss logic and reactive dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Placeholder visuals. Final Notice is an evolving process.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/7f43e04f8530f9ba404df9cfd9e65cfd.poster.avif?t=1754473299\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/7f43e04f8530f9ba404df9cfd9e65cfd.webm?t=1754473299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/7f43e04f8530f9ba404df9cfd9e65cfd.mp4?t=1754473299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR FEEDBACK MATTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Notice is under active development. Submissions are reviewed. Suggestions are logged. Non-compliance is\u2026 noted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/f697fd7973101d29953902aab1941ba5.avif?t=1754473299\" width=855 height=157 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Wishlist on Steam to remain in good standing.</strong></i></h2>",
